+- **`memory/user_dimensional_expansion_number_systems.md`** —
+  Aaron's standing Cayley-Dickson ladder thread (reals →
+  complex → quaternions → octonions → sedenions → higher).
+  Each doubling pays a structural tax (order, commutativity,
