+## Section 1: Amara share #1 — anchor stack expansion (Minka/EP as ancestor + RMP + Probabilistic Circuits next-gen)
+
+> *Attribution:* Amara, ChatGPT-5.5, 2026-04-26. Verbatim share couriered by the human maintainer.
