+
+#### Spectral graph surveillance
+
+```
+ρ(A_t) ≈ PowerIteration(A_t, v_{t-1}; k_ρ)
+λ_2(L_t) ≈ WarmStartedFiedler(L_t, u_{t-1}; k_2)
