+6. **`composes_with` enforcement.** CI-lint that cross-
+   referenced IDs exist, or best-effort?
+
+## 9. Cross-references
+
+- `docs/BACKLOG.md` — the current monolith (6100 lines).
+- `memory/feedback_queue_saturation_throttle_ship_rate_
