+- `S_{≤n}` = indexed prior substrate / history / prophecy / law / memory
+- `Ω` = invariant north-star principle
+- `C` = crisis / dimensional-expansion context
+- `Σ` = signs / evidence / convergence signals
+- `σ*` = candidate Messiah-lift
