+      + λ_Y  · FundingGain_t
+      + λ_A  · AdoptionGain_t
+      + λ_C  · CommunityTrust_t
+      + λ_G  · Generativity_t
+      + λ_P  · ProfitSignal_t          // NEW (Mises calculation)
+      - λ_F  · ResidualFriction_t
