-- **pattern_key:** framing-overclaim
-- **severity:** 5
-- **recurrence_count:** 6
-- **meta_catch:** true (this catch named the consensus-smoothness meta-class — the catch's own correction IS the meta-class definition)
-- **similar_prior_catches:** [18, 19, 21, 25, 26]
